Stormbringer,  Elric, and Arioch all come from the Elric saga by Micheal
Moorcock. It's a fantasy serries that is different then most. It tends to be
very dark, and Elric is an early anti-hero. I didn't like the books that
much, but some people really do. You might be able to find them at your
local library, but they tend to be on the stolen books list. If you know of
a used book store you might find them there but it is unlikely. The people
who like these books tend not  to sell them.

On the other hand they will give you some insight into why elves are
chaotic. If you count whatever Elric is as an elf. Reading the books will be
mildly spoilerish about stormbringer as it does in the game pretty much what
it does in the book. Arioch and Elric are in the game mainly for flavor.



